# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every
# machine. Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) converts
# files to CRLF and `prettier --check` fails on the whole repo — an
# environment artifact, not a style problem (it bit the React version).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files, never converted
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
